# Purpose/owner: monitoring.LoadEnvironment selects the protected JSON policy file;
# type: absolute canonical local regular-file path, no URL, no secret value.
# Required for monitoring assembly; no environment fallback. Unknown keys fail.
# Example default policy is monitoring.json; values/ranges/defaults are documented
# in monitoring.schema.json and validated again by monitoring.Config.Validate.
# Secret handling: this file contains policy only; protected file mode <=0600 and
# original protected-parent/symlink checks still apply. No credentials are accepted.
# Mapping/precedence: parent global typed config passes only this exact key to
# LoadEnvironment, mounts the same file read-only in Compose/Helm, then injects
# Config and matching Recorder. No scattered os.Getenv or runtime download.
# Restart/reload: restart the control process after policy changes; epoch resets.
PROJECT_ONE_MONITORING_CONFIG_FILE=/run/projectone/config/monitoring.json
